Apple binaries

  The four binaries in VendorAssets/ (CoreFP, AppleMediaServices, commerce,
  CoreFP.icxs) are Apple copyright, extracted from a macOS restore image.
  They are included only because the signing protocol requires running them,
  and are not redistributable on their own terms.

