Resources carried over from the original DLiPA 1.4

  The Assets.car, app icons and the 14 Localizable.strings files in app/
  come from the original DLiPA 1.4 application, whose repository
  (https://github.com/AhmedBafkir/DLiPA) publishes no source and states no
  licence.

  They are carried over so this build is a drop-in replacement. Because no
  licence is granted, replacing them with originals is the safer choice if
  you plan to redistribute this widely.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Relationship to the original DLiPA

  This is an independent rebuild, not a patch of the original. The original
  ships only compiled artifacts, so every line here was written from the
  protocol requirements and from ipatool as a reference implementation.

  The bundle identifier is deliberately different
  (com.a23bc.dliparebuild, not com.ahmedbafkir.dlipa) so the two apps coexist
  rather than overwrite each other.
